{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Hanging out with Friends"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What Happened That Night"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect vs.The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "  <ol><li>We use the Present Perfect tense for actions which started in the past and are still happening now OR for finished actions which have a connection to the present.</li> <li>We use the Simple Past tense for past events or actions which have no connection to the present.</li></ol>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Rule\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect</span> is used when the time period has NOT finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You've looked gorgeous ever since.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You still look gorgeous.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Past</span> is used when the time period HAS finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I had a rough week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The week is over.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Exchanging Opinions / Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. <br/>You can exchange opinions if you and the other person have different opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span> <br/>Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/>An <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> builds on a simple question."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: What are you going to do after dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question</span>: Do you know what you're going to do after dinner? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you exchange opinions and ask for clarification, you can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">I know what you mean, but ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ... ?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ...?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you tell me why they're sad? (question in a sentence)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Don't you think it's hard to live on your own in a big city? (asking for clarification)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I know what you mean, but physical activity isn't for everyone, wouldn't you agree?  (asking for clarification)"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lonely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without friends or company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I spoke to a couple of people who feel lonely all the time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about social activities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to socialize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to spend time with others socially"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People find it hard to socialize in a big city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on your own"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "by yourself"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's hard to live on your own in a big city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meaningful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": 