1, "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a column about how to meet new people."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     What's going on, Sally? You look tired.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I had a rough week. I've almost completed my interviews for the article on friendship. I have a few left. Some stories are so depressing!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Are they? Can you tell me why they're sad?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I spoke to a couple of people who feel lonely all the time. They didn't really have friends growing up, and now they find it hard to socialize.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "23500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Don't you think it's hard to live on your own in a big city?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Yeah, I guess. I think there are places where you can meet people, though. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Do you have any suggestions where they could go?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Well, I've always thought that sports were a good way to make friends. I've had meaningful conversations after my yoga or pilates classes, for example.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "43000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    I know what you mean, but physical activity isn't for everyone, wouldn't you agree?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I'm not sure I agree with that. You can join classes at any level. You don't have to be a world-class athlete to take up a new sport. I only started getting fit when I started college. I still remember the night I made that decision!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    You've looked gorgeous ever since, dear.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}